title Cassette bound (mono card with 44.1 and 48 kHz, both libraries): Settings shows Codec and Sample rate (a 16-bit only card: no Bit depth row); the Codec picker lists the six quick presets then WAV, FLAC and Opus with sizes per minute at the card's format, hours free and the footer; Esc keeps the choice
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD level
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODECS both
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
key s
wait 500
expect text "Codec"
shot settings
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
expect text "Sample rate"
expect notext "Bit depth"
expect text "48 kHz"
expect text "Record timer"
shot settings-rows
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
key s
wait 500
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect text "Quick presets"
expect text "Opus speech 24 kbps"
expect text "5.8 MB/min"
expect text "Sizes for 48 kHz, 16-bit, this card"
shot picker-top
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
wait 300
shot picker-bottom
expect text "Codecs"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "Codec"
say Esc closed the picker without a change (no setting_choice)
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
